      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MAKE A RUPEE (2) goes very well at the course and distance with four wins and a placing from nine starts. Missed the frame latest (17.63) when sixth over 300m at this track in a Grade 5. Has the ability and looks a key chance here. HOPE I CAN (4) has hit the frame here at the last two runs, most recently finishing second beaten a nose (17.20). Still to record a win from this draw but has never missed the frame in three starts. Leading player again. HEIDI BONUS (1) was below best last time but prior to that was narrowly beaten when seventh (17.22) in a Grade 5 at this track. Good beginner and aided by the inside draw. Well placed here and can atone this time. RIPPLE ROSE (3) generally performs well here at this distance.",
